  m_Name: CeryxDream
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  startingNodeID: 0
  nodes:
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 0
    nextNodeID: choices0
    text: My son, it pains me to see you brought so low.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: choices0
    nextNodeID: 
    text: 
    choices:
    - text: Father!
      nextNodeID: Confidence
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    - text: Father?
      nextNodeID: Doubt1
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Confidence
    nextNodeID: Future1
    text: I am, and you will be still more glad that I am here, because I have gifts
      for you.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Doubt1
    nextNodeID: Doubt2
    text: You feel some doubt about it? I can reassure you.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Doubt2
    nextNodeID: Future1
    text: I have divine gifts to grant you, which only a god could provide.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Future1
    nextNodeID: Future2
    text: Not only are you innocent, but you are a demigod.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Future2
    nextNodeID: Future3
    text: "You shouldn\u2019t be kept here, it would be a great waste of your power."
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Future3
    nextNodeID: Question
    text: You will go out into the world, just as you asked, and you will become
      a hero.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Question
    nextNodeID: Gifts1
    text: Thank you, but how can I escape?
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Gifts1
    nextNodeID: Gifts2
    text: The tools I have to give you will make that possible.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Gifts2
    nextNodeID: Gifts3
    text: First, I will give you a Caduceus, which you can use to move faster as
      you travel.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Gifts3
    nextNodeID: Gifts4
    text: It is like the one I use, and although its power is not equal, it may have
      unexpected uses for you.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: Gifts4
    nextNodeID: choices1
    text: When you will wake, you will find another gift which I have left for you.
      I think you will find it useful as well.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: choices1
    nextNodeID: 
    text: 
    choices:
    - text: But how can I become a hero?
      nextNodeID: WakeUp
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    - text: Where should I go once I get out of here?
      nextNodeID: WakeUp
      outcome:
        flagsToSet: []
        statChanges: 
        questsID: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: WakeUp
    nextNodeID: 
    text: Now my son, you must awake, and make your way out of the Desmoterion to
      freedom.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Hermes
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
